{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_title", "source_sha256": "f14869d914f4077a8f2e30bcfedc29395f57904f40b384be85973dd93fbfcb2f", "ja": "針を進めて", "zh": "拨动指针", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bfc1b715901eba9ab94c1f0312af63f6c6371d81bd500f5a80f4d07f125861be", "ja": "センター公演を目前に風邪をひいた静香。\n無事回復し公演を終えると、ジャパン音楽\nフェスのソロ出演オファーが舞い込む。喜び\nと不安に揺れる静香だったが、仲間やプロデ\nューサーに背中を押され、挑戦を決意する。", "zh": "在作为C位公演的前夕，静香患上了感冒。\n顺利康复并完成公演后，她收到了日本音乐节\n的个人出演邀约。虽然静香在喜悦与不安中\n动摇不定，但在伙伴与制作人的鼓励下，\n她下定决心接受挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1000_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "0bf6e7cf11af43298bb0ad578cf1a37d046197d45628684f97f7492863d4062a", "ja": "お、おはようございます！\nあの、皆さん、ご迷惑お掛けしました！", "zh": "早、早上好！\n那个，给大家添麻烦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "5ffebdad0f8a27d6bf55af0dc20b3418127d00daf17c9f99b14ef036e6f1fbdd", "ja": "お医者さんにも、ちゃんと許可をもらいました。\n今日から、またよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我也得到了医生的许可。\n从今天起，还请大家多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4d2b1c74aa51ba65ab2cdd7566958e2964ad7b98f42633110533b3a77175d964", "ja": "お帰りなさい、静香ちゃん！　……うん。\n顔色も声も、すっかり良くなったみたいだね。", "zh": "欢迎回来，静香！……嗯。\n你的脸色和声音，看来都已经完全恢复了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "f6a36200ebe219fea751a4cecbd5ec315b96280a2d7a58ee29a8aa243ddde762", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます。\nもうすっかり元気ですから！", "zh": "是的，谢谢。\n我已经完全恢复精神了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "4cab14849a8b24b7007b01a061194f6e8e07182317dd46930eb105644dcb7069", "ja": "あんなにみんなに心配かけておいて……\nほんと、子どもみたいね。", "zh": "让大家那么担心……\n真像个小孩子一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "1eb147d15d06c3db9dadd37de9f2df656951aa25f9a963853b66d229069f9884", "ja": "ううっ。", "zh": "呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1007_p", "source_sha256": "984d2b80d810d5d110de1f090c9f065ad96a9e9ff9199b163b547acd7f1d7ad0", "ja": "まあまあ。それじゃ、全員揃ったところで\n改めて定期公演のレッスン開始だ。", "zh": "好啦好啦。那么，既然大家都到齐了，\n现在重新开始定期公演的练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5fce9f81a0ec5cce22b2bad5bc213b8931f1e47763d233faa30120f0618dba13", "ja": "俺は打ち合わせで抜けないとなんだけど……\nみんな、後はよろしく頼んだ！", "zh": "我得去开会，不能继续了……\n接下来就拜托大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "88797729c44d26ae89f28546e2f1778cf374699258c4c50f16e63fc3da7a7cd8", "ja": "ふぅ……振り付けは、なんとか頭に入ったかな。\nあとは……。", "zh": "呼……舞蹈动作总算是记住了。\n接下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "27743002faf65a7f51416bbed1ea106eec90d7a14d4a69511b0864621225cc76", "ja": "お疲れさま、静香ちゃん。\n少し休憩して、ドリンク飲まない？", "zh": "辛苦了，静香。\n要不要稍微休息一下，喝点饮料？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "d19515002753228d5391e0fe6ed7087bab29c35d0ae322cb93ea168df9369705", "ja": "あ、歌織さん。\nありがとうございます、いただきます！", "zh": "啊，歌织姐。谢谢您，那我就喝了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "ecd1a2a0b57d6da52d39e57eeed8973508f84a888176fc9cf0ae59f4e704578d", "ja": "ふふっ。\n静香ちゃん、なんだかとっても楽しそうね。", "zh": "呵呵。\n静香，感觉你特别开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "18165eddb0d1096861312731cbda3f40eb8e7235714d78c888e6d1004738f30e", "ja": "本当。何か、いいことでもあったの？", "zh": "真的。是遇到什么好事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "595b7e80424b40c5043074cf7ff95ade7bb108cbb1f3b8df29bf63919d6cd32b", "ja": "いえ、特に何かあったわけじゃないんですけど……\nレッスンに出られるのが、嬉しくて楽しいっていうか。", "zh": "没有，倒也不是发生了什么特别的事……\n只是觉得能来参加课程，很开心又很快乐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "0126bf6740d5c0e41b482bab4b1764d6f5c5c875d36fddf0b618f587ad95a063", "ja": "レッスンに出られるのが、嬉しくて楽しい……？\n静香、変わってるの。", "zh": "能参加练习让你又高兴又开心……？  \n静香，你真奇怪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "ce81a6d1decb1688eacb141badda12641407bb791d1294f9c3cd310cda1fa44f", "ja": "そうですよね。レッスンはきついし大変なのに、\n変だなって、自分でも思うんですけど……。", "zh": "是啊。明明训练又辛苦又累，自己也觉得有点奇怪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "7b15933778db2ad93f73a24b09e82715f1f4ff40869f2b2ffc5e95e044d7154a", "ja": "私、今すごく楽しいんです。", "zh": "我现在真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "48b45a8b7fbd8034eef586cd3573d3334e305b7a93a0d36e41adf178c83a6964", "ja": "……いいんじゃないの。\n楽しいのは、いいことでしょ。", "zh": "……挺好的不是吗。\n开心总归是件好事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "7693cb986ea65f8da66ba5626af690c9ac8e25165e83fd0364fa2ef71c347caa", "ja": "志保……。", "zh": "志保……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "65a5d49f48426740af19a9ef024350e213882f165a1fb540ef1d6bacbe16ea52", "ja": "あ、そろそろ休憩終わりだね。\nじゃあ次は、全員で頭から通してみようか？", "zh": "啊，休息时间差不多要结束了。\n那么接下来，大家从头到尾完整排练一遍吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "407538028dec6881b70db0a8aa5d104df84e47f49c8e9a73cc3309b97c27ae69", "ja": "はいっ、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好的，请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1022_null", "source_sha256": "c710de22af2d5a9636c0d1f4b65c3da75cb1bbc836b3f6ef923b9d5b8acddf22", "ja": "レッスン終了後……", "zh": "练习结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1023_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "ecde27970a419597c8d5c195266ac0ff92b8ee22834db8a44a8f4db2d9d220cd", "ja": "失礼します。\n……お疲れさまです、{$P$}。", "zh": "打扰了。\n……辛苦了，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a3525cb6064476402e3c226dd566e37b8ff7f2ec13a1f880db85499ba7c7bfef", "ja": "あ、静香、お疲れさま。今日は付き添いできなくて\n悪かったな。レッスン、どうだった？", "zh": "啊，静香，辛苦了。今天没能陪你去，真是抱歉。课程进行得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "e3a30e3bf9e703bcbd63630ee715c48694cd55ba65a1ae5c106bd0dce70741eb", "ja": "順調です。私が参加しない曲を中心に\n進めてもらっていたので、遅れもほとんどありません。", "zh": "进展顺利。因为主要练习的是我不参加的歌曲，所以几乎没耽误进度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1027_p", "source_sha256": "ca388e75fd7079676d1812ae6063b254f39529c95bb126fb5ea6856ac9b78598", "ja": "そうか、よかった。\n……その様子だと、体調も問題ないみたいだな？", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。\n……看你的样子，身体状况似乎也没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "3e91f2a68b8178104bb1921fd0f148e8f19b99219c1c80b6b68fd3bc20136958", "ja": "はい。過保護なプロデューサーに、\nしっかり休ませてもらいましたから。", "zh": "是的。因为有过度保护的制作人盯着，我好好休息了一番。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1029_p", "source_sha256": "e741a56b11e734dda76c5aa82864483da174dc71264acaba83b6c2c3b6073918", "ja": "まぁ、そう言わないでくれ。\n体のケアは、大切だからな。", "zh": "嘛，别这么说。身体护理很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "ce4f3e9780294f5298a6f617068d2bedb433081c34d7c3263d70d1fb86f992fb", "ja": "はい、わかっています。\n……ありがとうございました。", "zh": "好的，我知道了。  \n……谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "5047fa5f2338d481d5fd04a8833aa9b0c18993228a4ed1656a0c8bde28624f1a", "ja": "{$P$}。私、レッスンを\n休んでいる間に、気づいたことがあって。", "zh": "{$P$}。我在休息不上课的这段时间里，发现了一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "44b4d71ee8399a0ea348e4af4cf68d9bae85c802062ca04c108cc7c0df2a93d7", "ja": "看病は、母がしてくれたんですけど……\n父も、何度か部屋に様子を見にきてくれたんです。", "zh": "照顾我的是妈妈……不过，爸爸也来看过我好几次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1033_p", "source_sha256": "0f20e341fe1e64130b5b30226335419bb71e44ed2350a36241053e84d6659ba0", "ja": "お父さんにしてみたら、静香は大事な娘さんだ。\n心配するのは当然だと思うよ。", "zh": "对你父亲来说，静香是他珍爱的女儿。会担心你也是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "bb4e8633a1c5f6b4ead778764bb2bb8057a45f662d854c45a4cd4f254cae2b33", "ja": "はい。……父から見た私は、まだまだ子どもで。\nだから……いろいろ心配なだけなんだって。", "zh": "是的……在父亲眼里，我还是个孩子。\n所以……只是有很多事情让他放心不下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1035_p", "source_sha256": "0914d2450cd7e52b11588e91bd2a20573bbdad9774c7533e03534f6f279513ec", "ja": "うん。……そうだな。", "zh": "嗯。……也是呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "6b2cb09ea91c5716bddf28bcb9c7ad57e8388d285e11db2522c93a40de9256cd", "ja": "{$P$}も、風花さんや歌織さんも\nですけど。私は、大勢の人に見守られているんですね。", "zh": "不仅是{$P$}先生，风花小姐和歌织小姐也是……我一直被这么多人守望着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "e6f6d2fa63185ad8b13c7b68f5b40266421de7544f98bf0337eb1ce39696740e", "ja": "それはきっと、当たり前じゃなくて……\nありがたいことなんだなって、思いました。", "zh": "我想，这一定不是理所当然的……\n而是一件值得感激的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1038_p", "source_sha256": "74bc3382d632fc1f821cdc65992906c332f18baf2720d5866f294455e85647af", "ja": "静香……。", "zh": "静香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "ff07a0df277b28c631fbb73b5e11b303b64b0f77c49e394b1c43870da70f6fe7", "ja": "でも、私だっていつまでも子どもじゃありませんから！\n大丈夫だってこと、絶対に納得させてみせます。", "zh": "不过，我也不可能永远都是小孩子！\n我一定会让您彻底相信，我已经没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "c5d1aa31143e8318897b2bec13eb67d04d986ea0cecdf36b0724b2bd362677dd", "ja": "{$P$}。\nこれからも、私を助けてくれますか。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n今后也会继续帮助我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1041_p", "source_sha256": "83cc2cdb19c2125e04080c9c0cde5059cf7adfa8bf8a3da1b2db1b210982b2b6", "ja": "もちろん。俺は最上静香のプロデューサーだ。", "zh": "当然了。我可是最上静香的制作人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1042_p", "source_sha256": "91ff4aec5a344ec541ae6278691f91003156d30b7ec642524d51add4ca7223cb", "ja": "静香が望む限り、ステージに立ち続けられるように\n努める。それが俺の役目だよ。", "zh": "只要静香还想站在舞台上，我就会尽力让她能够一直坚持下去。这就是我的职责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "55d10977b6cf06dca81c32fcdf79de90e4b698576750af1cc3650e9dc51ede71", "ja": "{$P$}……\nあ、ありがとうございます……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n啊，谢谢您……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1044_015siz", "source_sha256": "925751dd5faeb53105417248d5d44a4083518d55298f0662bafa86fc56b41cef", "ja": "そ、それじゃ私、帰りますね！\nお疲れさまでした！", "zh": "那、那我就先回去了！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1045_p", "source_sha256": "d7021a7d93716f5c48793d7b98548f6405d0188b7f821f03709fcd35e3f946ca", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま！　気をつけて！", "zh": "啊，辛苦了！路上小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1046_p", "source_sha256": "09ae02d3df29915fd5bc254d216104d8db9dad9f53807d6bcda388c9138a232e", "ja": "（自分では「まだまだ子ども」だと言っていたけど。\n静香はちゃんと、成長していっている……）", "zh": "（她明明还说自己“还是个小孩子”。可静香确实在不断成长……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1047_p", "source_sha256": "4a6af32de58f9c04600bebea92513350438916d47dd983a362f489b3503f4704", "ja": "（いつかお父さんに認めてもらうまで……\n一緒に頑張ろうな、静香！）", "zh": "（直到有一天得到父亲的认可……一起努力吧，静香！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1048_p", "source_sha256": "04d5c75fac1ef74602da798b8e0e74d0a84c3b4f9eff0c5f4f4660e04d182ad7", "ja": "（静香の新曲お披露目公演は、無事終了した。\nそして、次の日……）", "zh": "（静香的新曲发布公演顺利结束了。\n然后，第二天……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1049_p", "source_sha256": "1153a8ef95822feffe4cdf2cf4b5ced1975f9403d17f5890941ce58f5632d9de", "ja": "はい、765プロ……あっ、制作プロダクションの……\nお世話になっております。", "zh": "您好，765事务所……啊，是制作公司的……承蒙关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1050_p", "source_sha256": "9cb52fb0775e78f4569666ab787ed15240f97cb81a8879331b6b8735d337eb2b", "ja": "ジャパン音楽フェス？\nはい、もちろん知っていますけど……。", "zh": "日本音乐节？\n是的，我当然知道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1051_p", "source_sha256": "1bc4e52d56858d74e1b64ab0743163cb57e9d897f5550635a7fe04d87d9771c1", "ja": "……えっ。うちの最上を、ですか！？", "zh": "……咦。是说我们家的最上吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1052_015siz", "source_sha256": "da6bca4f7e6ff7ac7e093bb3a9b28cc8fc7f3cef38cd565f29abb818dedee442", "ja": "ジャパン音楽フェスに、ソロ出演……\nわ、私がですか！！？", "zh": "在日本音乐节上单独出演……\n我、我吗！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1053_p", "source_sha256": "289e1ebac2598a8ecc314ec705199a7c15ea5765787270750d8fb70a1a8a1abd", "ja": "ああ。先方のプロデューサーが、この前の\n劇場公演を観に来ていたんだそうだ。", "zh": "啊。听说对方的制作人之前来看过剧场公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1054_p", "source_sha256": "8162c1fe32c6135de6392bc95b8e1e0ee1b546890c7d8d1ac9757cbe62a62d3d", "ja": "アイドル枠のひとりとして、静香に話が来ている。\nどうだ、参加してみないか？", "zh": "静香收到了作为偶像成员参加的邀请。怎么样，要不要参加试试？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1055_015siz", "source_sha256": "2bbe26fa852593772de3a82d020c3dd60eb9d45ce3344e35bcce23e71a0cb5c0", "ja": "で、でも、ジャパン音楽フェスって、\nあの有名なジャパン音楽フェスですよね？", "zh": "可、可是，Japan音乐节……就是那个很有名的Japan音乐节，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1056_015siz", "source_sha256": "944e286ea711d6f54a8f541c1fc887c6a0ea227b37beb608cfed465d2071cc8c", "ja": "そんな大きな仕事、\n私の一存で決めるわけには……。", "zh": "那么重大的工作……我不能擅自做决定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1057_p", "source_sha256": "d4b3ca5269a83220c83e2666f3a156f73d11e5ace0dd5171436af0757d2ac9cf", "ja": "もちろん、社長からは出演の許可をもらった。\n宣伝にもなるし、出演は大歓迎だけど……", "zh": "当然，我已经得到社长许可，可以出演。还能起到宣传作用，所以出演当然没问题，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1058_p", "source_sha256": "ea7803517ab105ab28819d8c2b07f7c428d273bf14fa16356366871956700b95", "ja": "最終的には、静香が出たいかどうかで\n決めていいそうだよ。", "zh": "最终还是要看静香你自己想不想出演，\n由你来决定就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1059_015siz", "source_sha256": "b32516a9c1330e9a3e27e903bd9e90fd5839bd184d87bc0b13c689a6a4f35501", "ja": "あ……。えっと、あの。\nす、すこし考えさせてください……。", "zh": "啊……那个，我……让我、让我稍微考虑一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1060_003mik", "source_sha256": "614edd24b2128c51b2f3a624ae667bfbe728d3911a837c3424fdce51be93c602", "ja": "え？　……静香、出ないの？\n楽しそうなお仕事なのに。", "zh": "咦？……静香，你不参加吗？明明是看起来很有趣的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1061_033sih", "source_sha256": "b90de34b51caecfbb0f03b182d20d5c28f33038c50bc703cf0ed3038e094fa37", "ja": "あんまり、うれしそうじゃないのね。\n静香なら飛びつくかと思ったのに。", "zh": "看起来没那么高兴呢。\n我还以为静香的话肯定会抢着去呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1062_033sih", "source_sha256": "df6cf5e731bf0fcd510a7c3528ccced2d8e6239ed55bc0098b52e427d54fd429", "ja": "大きいイベントだってこと、気にしてるみたいだけど。\n……もしかして、怖いの？", "zh": "你好像很在意这是一场大型活动。\n……难不成，是在害怕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1063_015siz", "source_sha256": "e5ee00ae1566caff013aed00484f57c692a270d43503409d0e4404c516d9607e", "ja": "！？\nべ、別に、そういうわけじゃ……！", "zh": "！？\n没、没什么，不是那样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1064_033sih", "source_sha256": "8ec6d78e31d97d241258f3f2dc48ccc962268b0a0db67264c1ad87d10f27c674", "ja": "変なところで臆病なのね。……劇場の中だけの\nアイドルで、いたくないんじゃなかったの？", "zh": "在奇怪的地方胆小呢。……你不是不想\n只做个局限在剧场里的偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1065_033sih", "source_sha256": "5a6b283c2633f9e79482af1203beefa2c3c4c7113762eb1c0251e82211ec966b", "ja": "未来が今、ひとりでいろいろ頑張ってるのだって……\nあなたがそう言ったからなんじゃないの？", "zh": "未来现在一个人努力做各种事情，不也是因为你那么说了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1067_p", "source_sha256": "8ff0623d0447d8a3c96f59d2d0232afa2eb5f35ef028e7ae0f63aed07f6e3795", "ja": "志保。\n後は俺が話すから……。", "zh": "志保。\n接下来由我来说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1068_033sih", "source_sha256": "3c8c2d5eed0fc3f97516902d6069edcf36e10fce4af6c750d2f82943d0b3abf6", "ja": "いいえ、{$P$}さん。\n私は同じアイドルとして、納得できません。", "zh": "不，{$P$}先生。\n作为偶像，我无法接受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1069_033sih", "source_sha256": "a8deca13f45e7dd19b2e90e0d475378159ded994ee1e0d617f6968233343205c", "ja": "静香。\nあなた、どうしてアイドルになったの？", "zh": "静香。\n你为什么会成为偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1070_015siz", "source_sha256": "69fcef36d621b5d173a68253c91bbc7a27787a682417809a79fcf033fc25fd13", "ja": "え！？　ど、どうしてって……\nそれは、小さい頃から歌が好きで……。", "zh": "诶！？你、你问为什么……\n那是因为，我从小就喜欢唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1071_033sih", "source_sha256": "aea109eae9cd46dd296a7fbb5110bf32d3fd239a0aad00f39795dfd99b78f49c", "ja": "そういうことを聞いてるんじゃないの。\nわかってるでしょ。", "zh": "我问的不是这种事。\n你明白的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1072_015siz", "source_sha256": "a1d4c911feb5895093725b03f0b50cd2c57b84cd4e7d7d6048cb472fe90cd5f8", "ja": "私は……歌うことが、好きだからよ。\nでも……。", "zh": "我……是因为喜欢唱歌。可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
