{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1075_052kao", "source_sha256": "2c8e5f84f3907e30604214d2a76f1a1d981cdaa20c1520b683fbc6f5d9cee2d7", "ja": "志保ちゃん、もうその辺で……\n焦らなくていいのよ、静香ちゃん。", "zh": "志保，先到此为止吧……\n不用着急的，静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1076_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e3e8de71325008f6461364d0c27639ec8e2a2e96058965164ce025ea5af43011", "ja": "そうだよ、静香ちゃん。志保ちゃんも。\nまだ考える時間はあるんだから。", "zh": "是啊，静香。志保也是。\n还有时间慢慢考虑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1077_033sih", "source_sha256": "9eb2793a9d737d837a142c4d21227bb7fb4d9dbf2f4239c4a67dd2d8c226b330", "ja": "……すみません。\nすこし、言い過ぎました。", "zh": "……对不起。\n我稍微有点说得过头了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1078_003mik", "source_sha256": "a935f5505e8579fc98b43b7415c7b96259730d79cca79fd77f02abca26d3f060", "ja": "ミキは、志保の言うことちょっとわかるかな。\nジャパン音楽フェスでしょ？", "zh": "美希大概能理解志保想说什么。\n是日本音乐节吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1079_003mik", "source_sha256": "56f25176697044820a5cb058ff2b1e043de80b529793c5a692401971e2d0ab6b", "ja": "出演するのは、アイドルだけじゃないし。\nブレイクしたいなら、チャンスだって思うな。", "zh": "参加演出的也不只有偶像嘛。\n如果想走红，我觉得这可是个机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1081_p", "source_sha256": "3a5d55431ed6bc28b0af5e4f3a11fde229501b2c607d255a832326902eb2c3a9", "ja": "静香、志保。ふたりが真剣な事はわかってる。\n心配しなくても、大丈夫だ。", "zh": "静香、志保，我知道你们两个都很认真。不用担心，没事的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1082_p", "source_sha256": "cc1f14b96c0cf70ee3fa0ead79eecdfced2165e88987c1ff48ce1b42e356a285", "ja": "静香、回答期限まではまだ時間はある。\nゆっくり考えよう。", "zh": "静香，距离回复期限还有时间。慢慢考虑吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_121_1083_015siz", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
